WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.675
Run this example to compare several functions at
once UPPER and

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:11.223
LOWER change letter case BTRIM removes spaces from
the beginning and

00:00:11.249 --> 00:00:18.329
end INITCAP creates a display-style name after
trimming LENGTH

00:00:18.356 --> 00:00:23.000
shows why invisible spaces matter raw and trimmed
strings can have different lengths even when

00:00:23.027 --> 00:00:24.474
they look similar on screen
